    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">00:02:05</a>:只有自己的世界：反思男性的自我坚强主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">00:07:29</a>:自我反思与张硕的比较：我的问题与张硕的问题不同吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">00:14:56</a>:找回同理心，活得像个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">00:22:27</a>:张硕的亲密关系困境与成长之路：从紧张到沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">00:29:59</a>:家务事：一个复杂的话题，如何协调个人和工作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">00:37:26</a>:财务账目与家庭责任：如何平衡个人收入与家庭支出？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2696">00:44:56</a>:自我主义的背后：独生子女和家庭多子女的心理差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3146">00:52:26</a>:家务劳动不被重视的情绪劳动：探讨性别差异和平衡的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3595">00:59:55</a>:人际关系的互动与动态变化：对比与互补</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4044">01:07:24</a>:亲密关系中的互动和在外互动的理解与包容</span></p>]]></description>
